  <!-- 1. Actual paths -->
  <section class="lp-section hw-paths">
    <div class="lp-shell">
      <p class="lp-eyebrow">The execution reality</p>
      <h2 class="lp-h2">One expected process. <span class="hw-accent">Many actual paths.</span></h2>
      <p class="lp-lead">A transaction can follow the approved process, or take a different route through repeated validation, waiting, manual review and exceptions. The outcome looks the same. The cost and the risk do not.</p>
      <figure class="hw-figure hw-wide" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative account-opening transaction: one expected path and three observed execution variants including rework and manual approval">
