 x="425" y="242">Payments / cases</text><text font-size="9" font-weight="400" x="425" y="254">Review event</text></g></svg>
        <figcaption>Illustration · from the insight back to the source system</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Fits the bank as it is -->
  <section class="lp-section hw-deploy">
    <div class="lp-shell hw-split">
