        <h2 class="lp-h2">Fits the bank as it is.</h2>
        <dl class="hw-faq">
          <dt>What does the bank need to do?</dt>
          <dd>Provide read-only access to the relevant records. RE-ViVE handles the reconstruction and the analysis.</dd>
          <dt>Will it work with what the bank already runs?</dt>
          <dd>Core banking, CRM, workflow platforms, databases, files and custom applications, with no new operational system.</dd>
          <dt>Where does the data sit?</dt>
          <dd>On-premises, private cloud or the bank's own cloud. Nothing is written back to source systems.</dd>
